{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上第一条最大号白字，粉色高亮的“心里又热了起来”最容易抓眼；随后第二条红色高亮“有了劲头”“不再整天跟从前的事较劲”也很显眼。四条文字的彩色强调都比较突出。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前自然亲近的日子，盼望以后还能有那样的相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他重新有了生活的劲头，却又担心还要等很久才能遇到亲近的人；最终决定无论能否遇到，都要好好过自己的日子，不再为了留住别人而忍受委屈。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"四条大号文字都有各自醒目的彩色强调，粉色、红色、紫色、绿色同时争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在四块里，需要把回忆带来的温暖、重新振作、对等待的担忧和最后的自我接纳串起来才能理解完整变化。\",\n    \"每块主句都包含不止一层意思，第一条抓到情绪后，还需要读其他句子才能判断人物最终的处境和态度。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2e6e726f-3eb5-4756-a59d-f8e6ff216664", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013416078774Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:35:00.066601+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1c7a781545f2affd4c09c591e5b020a1d928c9606b547885da4d335587104d4f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1ef